# textdomain: doggiowars
# Spanish translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Combate aéreo sobre islas vóxel flotantes — TÚ ERES el caza. 12 biomas de islas, volcanes y cascadas, acrobacias aéreas, terreno destructible y carreras de galgos tras un conejo dorado. Teclado + mando.
